    suspectPortrait: {fileID: 2590121644143778945, guid: 8bfeb21a7dd943b46b65b3be995508de, type: 3}
    detectiveAskMale: {fileID: 1979867624}
    detectiveAskFemale: {fileID: 323645273}
    suspectVoiceAudio: {fileID: 1048776094}
    detectiveDialogueText: Victor, server logs place your cryptographic passkey at the vault terminal at 21:40. Care to explain why the cypher protocol was breached?
    suspectDialogueText: Someone cloned my encryption key! I was in the cooling sub-level rebooting the quantum array. I didn't touch Dr. King's coffee or the vault!
